            0.164
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "考研加油站收集整理 http://www.kaoyan.com"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.181,
            0.279,
            0.198
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2000 生物化学"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.199,
            0.654,
            0.216
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "一、判断题(请用 “十” 和 “一” 分别表示对错) (15%)"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.218,
            0.851,
            0.272
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.188,
                0.218,
                0.796,
                0.235
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1. 氨基酸为氨基取代的羧酸，可直接用碱酸滴定法进行定量测定。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.237,
                0.85,
                0.272
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2. 肽平面内与 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\alpha"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " 碳原子形成的键能以任一角度自由旋转, 形成稳定的蛋白"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.274,
            0.262,
            0.29
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "质构象。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.292,
            0.715,
            0.309
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. 在代谢途径中，各步反应的自由能变化是可以相加的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.311,
            0.735,
            0.327
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. 胰高血糖素通过促进肝糖原和肌糖原的降解使血糖升高。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.329,
            0.715,
            0.346
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. 寡霉素作为电子传递抑制剂能有效地抑制 ATP 的合成。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.348,
            0.509,
            0.364
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. ATP 是生物体的能量贮存物质。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.366,
            0.735,
            0.383
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. 琥珀酸脱氢酶是三羧酸循环中唯一掺入线粒体内膜的酶。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.385,
            0.635,
            0.401
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8. 从丙酮酸形成葡萄糖共消耗6个高能磷酸键。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.403,
            0.848,
            0.438
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9. 生物体内四种核苷酸均可在核苷二磷酸水平上被还原成相应的脱氧核糖"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.44,
            0.262,
            0.457
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "核苷酸。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.459,
            0.594,
            0.475
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10. 大肠杆菌 DNA 聚合酶可以以 dUTP 为底物。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.477,
            0.585,
            0.493
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "11. 蛋白质的生物合成是从羧基端到氨基瑞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.496,
            0.585,
            0.512
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "12. 解旋酶(helicase)是拓扑异构酶的一种。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.515,
            0.524,
            0.531
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "13. RNase III 识别 RNA 的双螺旋区。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.533,
            0.609,
            0.55
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "14. 真核生物的所有 mRNA 都含有 poly(A) 结构。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.552,
            0.498,
            0.567
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "15. EcoRI 是第一类限制性内切酶。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.57,
            0.311,
            0.587
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "二、填空题(26%)"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 25,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.588,
            0.848,
            0.624
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Asp 的 pK1' = 2.09、pK2' = 3.86、PK3' = 9.82，其 pI 等于 (1)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.626,
            0.65,
            0.642
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 在 3.613:螺旋中，链内氢键在(2)之间形成。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 27,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.644,
            0.595,
            0.66
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. 酶的负协同效应使酶的(3)对(4)不敏感。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 28,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.662,
            0.795,
            0.679
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. 酶的辅助因子在酶促反应中起(5)作用，而酶蛋白决定酶的(6)。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 29,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.681,
            0.635,
            0.698
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. 硫辛酸通过中介传递(7)和(8)参与代谢过程。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 30,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.7,
            0.604,
            0.716
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. 神经节苷脂是一类含有 (9) 的鞘糖脂。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 31,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.718,
            0.715,
            0.735
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. 在磷脂的生物合成途径中，起载体作用的是（10）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 32,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.737,
            0.848,
            0.754
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8. 胆固醇生物合成的前体是 （11），合成途径中的调节酶是 （12）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 33,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.756,
            0.848,
            0.79
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9. 尿素是在（13）中合成的。合成一分子尿素消耗（14）个高能磷酸"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 34,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.792,
            0.645,
            0.809
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "键，向体外排出二分子 （15） 和一分子 （16）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 35,
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.811,
            0.545,
            0.827
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10. 所有鞘脂类的共同结构是 (17)。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 36,
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.829,
            0.631,
            0.846
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "11. DNA 聚合酶 I 所具有的三种主要催化活性分别"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 37,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.848,
            0.424,
            0.865
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "为 (18) (19) (20) 。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 38,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.866,
            0.816,
            0.883
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "12. 大肠杆菌不依赖 p 的转录终止子的结构特点是 (21) 和 (22)。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 39,
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.885,
            0.585,
            0.901
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "13. 端粒酶由蛋白质和 (23) 两部分组成。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 40,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
