          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.203,
            0.795,
            0.22
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 欲切除胰蛋白酶酶解肽段的 C 末端氨基酸，应选用的酶制剂为:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.222,
            0.827,
            0.238
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. 羧肽酶 A b. 羧肽酶 B c. 嗜热菌蛋白酶 d. 弹性蛋白酶"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.241,
            0.514,
            0.257
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. 肾上腺素是由( )衍生而来。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.26,
            0.657,
            0.275
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. Trp b. Tyr c. His d. Gln"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
